{"2334150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mechanical Fury - Prologue", "steam_appid": 2334150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> This is the Prologue to the main game currently in development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mechanical Fury</i></strong><i> blends the unyielding combat of </i><strong><i>Doom Eternal</i></strong><i> and the Incredibly vertical platforming of </i><strong><i>Ghostrunner</i></strong><i> to scratch that movement shooter itch!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.poster.avif?t=1764390070\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.webm?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.mp4?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With bloodthirsty mechs attacking from each direction, <strong>Eeach engagement becomes a thrilling puzzle.</strong> Every split-second decision will be the difference between life and death! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.poster.avif?t=1764390070\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.webm?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.mp4?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace gravity-defying action as you <strong>Grapple</strong>, <strong>Kick</strong> and <strong><i>DESTROY</i></strong> through hordes of enemies. Uncover the secrets of the Forbidden Island to dominate the arena! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.poster.avif?t=1764390070\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.webm?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.mp4?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your arm was severed and replaced with a grappling hook by the evil Doctor Adrian! Team up with your girlfriend and get revenge by obliterating his Machine Army before he invokes the<strong> Second Armageddon</strong>!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> This is the Prologue to the main game currently in development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mechanical Fury</i></strong><i> blends the unyielding combat of </i><strong><i>Doom Eternal</i></strong><i> and the Incredibly vertical platforming of </i><strong><i>Ghostrunner</i></strong><i> to scratch that movement shooter itch!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.poster.avif?t=1764390070\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.webm?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.mp4?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With bloodthirsty mechs attacking from each direction, <strong>Eeach engagement becomes a thrilling puzzle.</strong> Every split-second decision will be the difference between life and death! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.poster.avif?t=1764390070\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.webm?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.mp4?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace gravity-defying action as you <strong>Grapple</strong>, <strong>Kick</strong> and <strong><i>DESTROY</i></strong> through hordes of enemies. Uncover the secrets of the Forbidden Island to dominate the arena! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.poster.avif?t=1764390070\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.webm?t=1764390070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb